Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:57:58 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] v2: add keyed SipHash short_id and GF(2^64) degree-2 BCH
 syndrome decoding

Add keyed SipHash-2-4 64-bit short_id derivation and GF(2^64) degree-1 /
degree-2 BCH syndrome root finding (SolveDegree2, ComputeShortId, and
MerklixBucketChecksum) in set_reconciliation.{h,cpp}.
